        Key Drivers:
        • Technology category leads with $836K sales, 16% higher than lowest category
        • Furniture generates $742K in revenue, positioning as strong middle performer
        • Office Supplies trails at $719K but maintains competitive position with only $117K gap from leader

        Recommendations:
        • Expand Technology product lines and marketing given strongest performance
        • Investigate Office Supplies optimization opportunities to close revenue gap
